  "description": "Seonhwa lives in a city lined with luxury apartment complexes. Feeling bored as a housewife, she visits \"Hwajung Sauna\" on a friend's recommendation, which is said to have excellent facilities and high customer satisfaction nearby. However, the sauna, which she had heard was women-only, is packed with men... Dizzying desires unfold within the confined space of a sauna.\n\n\"This is ridiculous... but I'm starting to feel good...\"\n\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/married_woman_sauna)",
